{"id":585,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"真面目な努力と探究で未来を切り拓く女子教育","feature_description":"豊島岡女子学園は、真面目に努力する姿勢を大切にし、学習とクラブ活動の両方を通じて自らを磨く女子校です。自主自律を重視するホームルーム、Academic Day、T-STEAM、海外研修や模擬国連など、多様な探究の機会を設けています。課題に向き合い、考えを深め、発信する経験を重ねながら、社会の変化に対応する力を育てます。日々の努力を将来の選択へつなげる教育が特徴です。","clubs":[{"id":11052,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11053,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11054,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11055,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11056,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11057,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11058,"name":"エアロビクス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11059,"name":"登山部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11060,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11061,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11062,"name":"政経部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11063,"name":"地歴部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11064,"name":"数学部","categ